      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 Ref + native stereo audio\nref2va DiT; 1344x768, 124 frames, 24 FPS, 20 base steps. No turbo LoRA.\n\nLoad H3 LightVAE independently selects the video encoder and decoder. Set either to none for the connected original component. Device and precision follow ComfyUI. Audio VAE stays original.\n\nReference tags start at 1: <Picture 1>, <Video 1>, <Audio 1>. Socket suffixes start at 0. Upload your reference; video inputs must be 24 FPS."
